hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1401","Narrated to us Muhammad bin Muammar bin Rabi’i, narrated to us Musa bin Masoud Abu Hudhayfah, Zaida narrated to us, on the authority of Hisham bin Urwa, on the authority of Fatima, On the authority of Asmaa, she said: The Prophet, may God bless him and grant him peace, ordered “the emancipation of a woman during a solar eclipse.” Al-Darimi told us, Musab bin Ubayd Allah Al-Zubayri told us, Abdul Aziz, meaning Al-Darawardi, told us on the authority of Hisham with this chain of transmission like it, And he said: “He ordered that she be freed when the sun was eclipsed.”"
